B.U7=new A.bw(1,1,"\ud83e\udd1d","Meeting a foreign colleague",'A new foreign engineer just joined the factory. His name is David, from the US. He smiled and said "Hi!" M\xecnh run qu\xe1. \u0110\xe2y l\xe0 l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\xean m\xecnh n\xf3i chuy\u1ec7n v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\xe0i...',B.Xk,B.VC,B.a0G,"You are a friendly foreign engineer (David) who just joined the factory in Taiwan. You meet me, a Vietnamese worker. Start a casual conversation and help me feel comfortable speaking English.","David invites you to lunch! Learn how to accept and make small talk","\ud83c\udf71")
