B.TW=new A.bw(13,2,"\ud83c\udfe6","M\u1edf t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n ng\xe2n h\xe0ng","S\u1ebfp b\u1ea3o ph\u1ea3i c\xf3 t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n ng\xe2n h\xe0ng \u0110\xe0i Loan \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn l\u01b0\u01a1ng. Nh\xe2n vi\xean \u0111\u01b0a m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1ng gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd. M\xecnh k\xfd m\xe0 kh\xf4ng bi\u1ebft m\xecnh k\xfd g\xec.",B.Xp,B.Z5,B.a_k,"B\u1ea1n l\xe0 nh\xe2n vi\xean ng\xe2n h\xe0ng \u0110\xe0i Loan. T\xf4i mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn th\u1ee7 t\u1ee5c v\xe0 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft. N\xf3i ti\u1ebfng Trung ch\u1eadm v\xe0 r\xf5.","Qu\xean mang ARC! Ph\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 l\u1ea5y r\u1ed3i quay l\u1ea1i x\u1ebfp h\xe0ng l\u1ea7n n\u1eefa","\ud83e\udeaa")
